{
  "esm": "2.2.0",
  "metadata": {
    "name": "mom6_cgrid_avg_v",
    "description": "The meridional cell-to-face average on the mom6_cgrid, the y mirror of mom6_cgrid_avg_u: the arithmetic mean of a cell field X [i,j,k] across a north face, avg_v(i,j,k) = 0.5*(X(i,j,k) + X(i,j+1,k)) (the MOM6 v-cell average, e.g. the hArea_v = 0.5*(Area_h(i,j)*h(i,j) + Area_h(i,j+1)*h(i,j+1)) of MOM_CoriolisAdv.F90 CorAdCalc :348-357 and the h_c + h_n face-thickness sums of MOM_PressureForce_FV.F90). SOLID-WALL BOUNDARY: the north face at the domain edge (j = N_J) is a wall with a zero-gradient halo, so the j = N_J region is the EXPLICIT mirror wall avg_v(i,N_J,k) = 0.5*(X(i,N_J,k) + X(i,N_J,k)) = X(i,N_J,k) — the mirrored neighbor is the cell itself, NOT a clamped read of a nonexistent cell. The rule is a named-op rule (esm-spec 9.6.8), applied once per consumer equation as mom6_cgrid_avg_v(X); X is a param whose shape must be declared [i,j,k] (esm-spec 9.6.1 where clause).",
    "license": "MIT",
    "tags": [
      "esd:rule",
      "family:mom6_cgrid",
      "grid:mom6_cgrid",
      "op:avg",
      "order:0",
      "bc:wall",
      "axes:i,j,k"
    ],
    "references": [
      {
        "citation": "Adcroft, A., et al. (2019). The GFDL global ocean and sea ice model OM4.0. Journal of Advances in Modeling Earth Systems, 11(10), 3167-3211.",
        "doi": "10.1029/2019MS001726"
      },
      {
        "citation": "MOM6 source: MOM_CoriolisAdv.F90 CorAdCalc hArea_u/hArea_v :348-357; the north-face convention of the mom6_cgrid grid.esm."
      }
    ]
  },
  "expression_template_imports": [
    {
      "ref": "../grid.esm"
    }
  ],
  "expression_templates": {
    "mom6_cgrid_avg_v": {
      "params": ["X"],
      "match": {
        "op": "mom6_cgrid_avg_v",
        "args": ["X"]
      },
      "where": {
        "X": {
          "shape": ["i", "j", "k"]
        }
      },
      "body": {
        "op": "makearray",
        "args": [],
        "regions": [
          [
            [1, "N_I"],
            [1, { "op": "-", "args": ["N_J", 1] }],
            [1, "N_K"]
          ],
          [
            [1, "N_I"],
            ["N_J", "N_J"],
            [1, "N_K"]
          ]
        ],
        "values": [
          {
            "op": "faq",
            "output_idx": ["i", "j", "k"],
            "args": ["X"],
            "ranges": {
              "i": [1, "N_I"],
              "j": [1, { "op": "-", "args": ["N_J", 1] }],
              "k": [1, "N_K"]
            },
            "expr": {
              "op": "*",
              "args": [
                {
                  "op": "const",
                  "args": [],
                  "value": 0.5,
                  "units": "1"
                },
                {
                  "op": "+",
                  "args": [
                    {
                      "op": "index",
                      "args": ["X", "i", "j", "k"]
                    },
                    {
                      "op": "index",
                      "args": ["X", "i", { "op": "+", "args": ["j", 1] }, "k"]
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
          },
          {
            "op": "faq",
            "output_idx": ["i", "j", "k"],
            "args": ["X"],
            "ranges": {
              "i": [1, "N_I"],
              "j": ["N_J", "N_J"],
              "k": [1, "N_K"]
            },
            "expr": {
              "op": "index",
              "args": ["X", "i", "N_J", "k"]
            }
          }
        ]
      }
    }
  }
}
